{#-
 Parecer Final de Monitoramento do Experimento — doc 27 §6

 14 secoes conforme §6.2. Documento construido ao longo do ciclo do
 Projeto Experimental (trimestral + consolidacao final).

 Contrato de contexto — todas as chaves sao obrigatorias (StrictUndefined).
 Providers em src/services/regulatory_documents.build_monitoring_opinion_data
 devem preencher todas, mesmo que com listas vazias ou '' para gracia.

 Chaves esperadas:
  - project: dict com id, title, objective, start_date, end_date, status
  - tenant: dict com legal_name, cnpj, trade_name, incorporation_date
  - technical_responsible: dict com full_name, professional_council,
    council_number, council_state (ou None)
  - scope: dict com activities (list), scale (dict)
  - schedule: dict com planned (list de fase/data), executed (list)
  - indicators: dict com mandatory (list), complementary (list),
    cada indicador com code, name, period, value, target, status
  - operational_evidence: dict com sops_count, sop_deviations, capa_actions
  - clinical_evidence: dict com consultations, prescriptions, outcomes (list)
  - pharmacovigilance: dict com adverse_events_count, sanitary_risks_count
  - anchors: dict com total, networks, verification_status_counts
  - findings: list de achados/aprendizados
  - recommendations: list de recomendacoes regulatorias
  - limitations: list de limitacoes
  - financial: dict opcional (None quando nao aplicavel)
  - attachments: list de anexos
  - generated_at: ISO string UTC
  - period_label: 'Parcial Q1' | 'Parcial Q2' | ... | 'Consolidacao Final'
  - document_version: 'v1' (do registry)
-#}
